Question: Driver Registration Form (HTML)

A startup named GreenGo is building an eco-friendly ride-sharing app.
The web team is designing a driver registration form in HTML to collect the following information:

Full Name
Email ID
Phone Number (10 digits only)
Password (must include:
at least one uppercase letter
one lowercase letter
one number
one special character)
Age (between 21 and 60)
Vehicle Registration Number (e.g., MH12AB1234 – exactly 10 characters)
City (Dropdown: Mumbai, Delhi, Bangalore)
A checkbox for accepting terms and conditions
Submit button